   "lines": [
    "At Oyster Bay L. I.",
    "Arrived about",
    "mid-day.",
    "Coming back",
    "here has recalled",
    "Father very vividly",
    "and very sadly",
    "to me. Every",
    "nook and corner",
    "about the place,",
    "every piece of",
    "furniture about",
    "the house is",
    "in some manner",
    "connected with",
    "him. It is impossible",
    "to tell in words",
    "how terribly I miss him."
   ],
